<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>What price would you recommend the company charge for a new movie? Be prepared to show your reasoning.</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer: Your answer may vary, but here is a sample.</para>
    <para> Based on the graph, the largest revenue comes when the price is between \($5\) and \($10\). It is hard to tell exactly, but perhaps \($9\), halfway between \($0\) and \($18\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->

